<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE V ENGLAND ONE-DAY SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE V ENGLAND ONE-DAY SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the third and final</p>
<p>one-day international between Zimbabwe and England at the Harare</p>
<p>Sports Club on Friday.</p>
<p>Zimbabwe</p>
<p> G.Flower c Mullally b White	    62</p>
<p> A.Waller run out			   19</p>
